    - target: {fileID: 8297611818316759015, guid: 70a1faa8de149934cb8b7a0b84792985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: message.Array.size
      value: 21
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8297611818316759015, guid: 70a1faa8de149934cb8b7a0b84792985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'message.Array.data[0]'
      value: 'MESSAGE TO THE WIDE WORLD:'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8297611818316759015, guid: 70a1faa8de149934cb8b7a0b84792985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'message.Array.data[1]'
      value: In order to make sentences...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8297611818316759015, guid: 70a1faa8de149934cb8b7a0b84792985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'message.Array.data[2]'
      value: ...you will need words.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8297611818316759015, guid: 70a1faa8de149934cb8b7a0b84792985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'message.Array.data[3]'
      value: Did you know, that while talking...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8297611818316759015, guid: 70a1faa8de149934cb8b7a0b84792985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'message.Array.data[4]'
      value: ...you can click on your collected words...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8297611818316759015, guid: 70a1faa8de149934cb8b7a0b84792985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'message.Array.data[5]'
      value: ...and they'll appear in your sentences?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8297611818316759015, guid: 70a1faa8de149934cb8b7a0b84792985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'message.Array.data[6]'
      value: But that's not all!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8297611818316759015, guid: 70a1faa8de149934cb8b7a0b84792985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'message.Array.data[7]'
      value: If you select a wrong word, you can click on it...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8297611818316759015, guid: 70a1faa8de149934cb8b7a0b84792985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'message.Array.data[8]'
      value: ...INSIDE the sentence?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8297611818316759015, guid: 70a1faa8de149934cb8b7a0b84792985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'message.Array.data[9]'
      value: You can even rearrange the words in the sentence by dragging them!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8297611818316759015, guid: 70a1faa8de149934cb8b7a0b84792985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'message.Array.data[10]'
      value: I love making sentences so much!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8297611818316759015, guid: 70a1faa8de149934cb8b7a0b84792985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'message.Array.data[11]'
      value: Sometimes, if you inspect things, you can learn new words as well!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8297611818316759015, guid: 70a1faa8de149934cb8b7a0b84792985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'message.Array.data[12]'
      value: Whenever you can inspect something, the excamation mark with the question
        mark next to it will appear!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8297611818316759015, guid: 70a1faa8de149934cb8b7a0b84792985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'message.Array.data[13]'
      value: The same way it appeared here.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8297611818316759015, guid: 70a1faa8de149934cb8b7a0b84792985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'message.Array.data[14]'
      value: So, whenever you see that symbol...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8297611818316759015, guid: 70a1faa8de149934cb8b7a0b84792985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'message.Array.data[15]'
      value: ...make sure to always inspect it!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8297611818316759015, guid: 70a1faa8de149934cb8b7a0b84792985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'message.Array.data[16]'
      value: Sincerely,
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8297611818316759015, guid: 70a1faa8de149934cb8b7a0b84792985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'message.Array.data[17]'
      value: A language fanatic.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8297611818316759015, guid: 70a1faa8de149934cb8b7a0b84792985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'message.Array.data[18]'
      value: ...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8297611818316759015, guid: 70a1faa8de149934cb8b7a0b84792985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'message.Array.data[19]'
      value: ......
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8297611818316759015, guid: 70a1faa8de149934cb8b7a0b84792985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'message.Array.data[20]'
      value: You're relieved to see, that the text is finally over.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
